<title>CANADA: Canada Q2 GDP rises 0.3 percent.</title>
<headline>Canada Q2 GDP rises 0.3 percent.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's real gross domestic product, at 1986 prices, rose a seasonally adjusted 0.3 percent in the second quarter from the first quarter, Statistics Canada said on Friday.</p>
<p>The economy grew by 1.3 percent at an annualized rate in the first quarter, the agency said.</p>
<p>    Real GDP	 pct chg    annualized pct chg   yr-yr pct</p>
<p>    Q2 96	    0.3 pct	 1.3 pct	     +1.2 pct</p>
<p>    GDP (blns C$, 1986 prices, S/A)  Q2 96     Q1 96   pct chg</p>
<p>    At market prices		     614.37   612.42   +0.3</p>
<p>    Final domestic demand		611.17   611.59   -0.1</p>
